sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cfg as m2e/configure_session
    participant Pilot as BSP pilot
    participant Queue as Event queue
    participant FSM as fsm::v2 FSM
    participant Ctx as FsmContext
    participant Bsp as ev_board_support
    participant Slac as ev_slac
    participant Iso as ISO15118_ev
    participant E2M as e2m/state

    Cfg->>Queue: ConfigureSession(SessionConfigParams)
    Queue->>Ctx: intercepted pre-FSM (validate + latch)
    Ctx->>E2M: command_ack Accepted/Rejected

    Pilot->>Queue: BspEvent(A/B/C)
    Queue->>FSM: feed(BspEvent)
    FSM->>Ctx: enter Plugged (enqueue BeginSession)
    Ctx->>E2M: state=Plugged
    Queue->>FSM: feed(BeginSession)
    Note over FSM,Ctx: resolve configured_session, default_session, or AcIec
    Pilot->>Queue: BspMeasurement(5 percent PWM)
    Queue->>FSM: feed(BspMeasurement)
    FSM->>Ctx: enter SlacMatching (ISO modes)
    Ctx->>Slac: trigger_matching()
    Ctx->>E2M: state=SlacMatching

    Slac-->>Queue: SlacState(MATCHED)
    Queue->>FSM: feed(SlacState)
    FSM->>Ctx: enter V2GNegotiating
    Ctx->>Iso: iso_start_charging(mode,...)
    Ctx->>E2M: state=V2GNegotiating

    Iso-->>Queue: IsoPowerReady
    Queue->>FSM: feed(IsoPowerReady)
    alt AC
        FSM->>Ctx: enter Charging
        Ctx->>Bsp: set_cp(C), allow_power_on(true)
    else DC
        Ctx->>Bsp: set_cp(C), allow_power_on(true)
        Note over FSM,Ctx: stay in V2GNegotiating
        Iso-->>Queue: IsoDcPowerOn
        Queue->>FSM: feed(IsoDcPowerOn)
        FSM->>Ctx: enter Charging
    end
    Ctx->>E2M: state=Charging
